#: src/ui/ui_common.cpp
msgid "The cabinet's side views are turned for its monitors' angle and edges: a gap between flat screens in 4:3, an overlap in 16:9. Joined turns their 3D to meet the middle one's edges (monitors touching, or a window over them), the 2D as it is; the others make one picture of the three, a flat, curved or dome screen's, the 2D bent with the 3D. Side by side or in windows, at once."
msgstr ""

